       {
        "title": "HOW TO MEASURE",
        "layout": {
         "data": [
          {
           "type": 0,
           "value": "<h3><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.kiwisizing.com/janasya-india-1788865795268.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"regular\" style=\"float: none;\"><br>HOW TO MEASURE</strong></h3><p>For the best fit, take your measurements comfortably without pulling the measuring tape too tight. Keep the tape straight and level for accurate measurements.</p><p><strong>SHOULDER</strong><br>Measure from the tip of one shoulder to the tip of the other shoulder.</p><p><strong>BUST</strong><br>Wrap the measuring tape around the fullest part of your bust, keeping it comfortably snug. Make sure the tape is straight across your back.</p><p><strong>WAIST</strong><br>Measure around your natural waistline, usually just above the belly button. Keep the tape comfortably snug without tightening it.</p><p><strong>HIPS</strong><br>Measure around the fullest part of your hips and seat. Keep the measuring tape level and comfortably snug.</p>"
          }
         ]
        }
